# What NOT to upload to AppSail from the configured build path.
#
# The configured build path is `.next/standalone`, not the repository root.
# That bundle must include its traced node_modules and .next server assets;
# excluding those names here makes AppSail deploy successfully but crash at
# runtime because the uploaded bundle is incomplete.
#
# Do not point AppSail at the repository root with this ignore file. Use
# `npm run pack:appsail` and deploy the `.next/standalone` build path.

.git
.git/**
.git/**/*

.claude
.claude/**
.claude/**/*

# Secrets belong in the AppSail service's environment variables, never inside
# the uploaded package.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.local.backup-*

*.log
catalyst-debug.log
